,"role":"Priest","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lm06jFDOH4LuqATAE6CUtrU7tuX.jpg"},{"id":1162285,"name":"Stéphane Auberghen","role":"Proctor","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fT1Dv0uAePMY0rmMs5BraXfuB4f.jpg"},{"id":5425,"name":"Christophe Rossignon","role":"Doctor #2","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xlEAUEu1owtvkFQNT9h684TryQV.jpg"},{"id":2281735,"name":"Nathalie Philip","role":"Julien's Nurse","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zjSY5et0JceW69jew0thD3nUASu.jpg"},{"id":2281738,"name":"Delphine Aerts","role":"Senior Center Nurse"},{"id":2097292,"name":"Isabelle Goethals Carre","role":"Senior Center Director","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6vcS6TYvRL59ldOWfIOzW8dVLjW.jpg"},{"id":2281741,"name":"Mathilde Verkinderen","role":"8-year-old Charlotte","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gnlmDltx5paldOOCFVG9WhIxk4x.jpg"},{"id":1531949,"name":"Melchior Lebeaut","role":"4-year-old Julien","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2MxiNd2QASf0K1pNh6XjDIMUsJD.jpg"},{"id":578705,"name":"Emmanuel LeMire","role":"Doctor #1","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pifVORmvb1QSFI7tdNOoNxiAa4O.jpg"},{"id":2281744,"name":"Jessica Rinalo","role":"Child"},{"id":2281745,"name":"Emmanuel Brunin","role":"Child"},{"id":2281746,"name":"Joeffrey Simon","role":"Child"},{"id":2281747,"name":"Amandine Courrire","role":"Child"},{"id":2281750,"name":"Jessica Vitello","role":"Child"},{"id":586211,"name":"Michel Angely","role":"Bus Driver","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kCFqWJhElQ5N5AflOMktXL7pj9r.jpg"},{"id":2281752,"name":"Fernand Kindt","role":"Scrabble Player"},{"id":2281756,"name":"Cédric Lombard","role":"Library Student","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5eZ8og4j3UBBWppOqLbSJaUwYLR.jpg"},{"id":1676240,"name":"Ingrid Juveneton","role":"Sylvie","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kJx1fn8ZdeLjdtJw1l4i91JE0Mf.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Amami se hai coraggio","overview":"Julien e Sophie hanno otto anni, ma sono diversi dai loro coetanei. I due bambini inventano un gioco che consiste nel lanciarsi sfide che implicano azioni sempre più audaci e coraggiose. Una scatola musicale è il simbolo delle loro scommesse. Una volta cresciuti si ritrovano talmente coinvolti da non riuscire più a uscirne mentre l'amicizia si trasforma in passione divorante.","tagline":"Se lo puoi pensare, lo puoi fare..."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Love Me If You Dare","overview":"As adults, best friends Julien and Sophie continue the odd game they started as children -- a fearless competition to outdo one another with daring and outrageous stunts. While they often act out to relieve one another's pain, their game might be a way to avoid the fact that they are truly meant for one another.","tagline":"When is love a game, and when is it not?"},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Sophie et Julien ont défini les règles du jeu. Ils en sont, pour le restant de leurs vies, les arbitres et souvent les victimes. « Cap ou pas cap ? — Cap ! Bien sûr ! » Ils sont cap de tout : du meilleur comme du pire. Bafouer tous les tabous, défier tous les interdits, braver toutes les autorités, rire, se faire mal. Cap de tout sauf, peut-être de s'avouer qu'ils s'aiment. Ce jeu commence avec un pari innocent : un pari afin d'oublier que Maman est gravement malade, afin d'oublier quand toute la classe te traite de sale polack. Et quelques paris plus tard, le jeu devient ce qu'il y a de plus beau, de plus fort dans la vie des deux enfants. Et ainsi la vie passe, le jeu reste, de plus en plus intense, comme la passion. Et chaque fois qu'ils se répondent « Cap ! », ils se disent « Je t'aime plus que ma propre vie. — Plus que ma propre vie ? — Cap ! ».","tagline":"T'es cap ?"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1bQWDogRVdyqINezOTRv0HSirVy.jpg",